    "## 6) Expected Value and Capital Allocation\n",
    "\n",
    "Risk-adjusted NPV: `eNPV = PoTS * Revenue - Cost`. Greedy allocation funds highest-eNPV assets first within a fixed budget."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 11,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
